Third-party references
----------------------

DeepSeek Harness (@deepseek-ai/dsh-*, MIT)
    The plugin contract this repository targets: Cordis host/client plugin
    halves, the `dsh.client` package declaration, the web client's ModuleLoader
    bundle format, the slot keys used for the sidebar tab and composer dock.

dsh-web-preview-panel (https://github.com/zoumutou/dsh-web-preview, MIT)
    Studied while learning the DSH client-plugin surface. No source is copied;
    the client bundle registration wrapper in packages/dsh-annotate/build.mjs was
    rewritten from the harness' documented format. Credit is given here because
    that plugin was the working reference for the plugin wiring, and it is the
    closest prior art for an in-harness element-annotation panel.

Codex (in-app browser) and Claude Design
    Product design references only — how an in-thread preview with element
    comments behaves — no code involved.
